  "body": "### ⚠️ Don't go through files changes this is purely code style! ⚠️\r\n\r\nRelated to #2245 \r\n\r\nI put `react/no-string-refs` to a warning until we go through theses files and fix them:\r\n\r\n```\r\n/Users/iam4x/algolia/instantsearchjs-v2/src/components/PriceRanges/PriceRangesForm.js\r\n  43:7   warning  Using this.refs is deprecated                          react/no-string-refs\r\n  44:20  warning  Using this.refs is deprecated                          react/no-string-refs\r\n  47:7   warning  Using this.refs is deprecated                          react/no-string-refs\r\n  47:44  warning  Using this.refs is deprecated                          react/no-string-refs\r\n  59:9   warning  Using string literals in ref attributes is deprecated  react/no-string-refs\r\n```",
